@startuml
' /relatorios/sprint3-t007/model/components.puml
' Sprint 03 | Análise Retroativa T007
' RF: RF-008 (Agrupar pares recíprocos no pairwise_similarity)

title Arquitetura de Componentes — Agrupamento de Pares Recíprocos (RF-008)

!define RF(x) note right of x : @rf: RF-008

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
  BorderColor #333333
  FontSize 12
}

' === CAMADA 1: API Layer ===
package "API Layer\n(api/)" as APILayer {
  [api/topic.py] as TopicComponent <<FastAPI Router>>
  note right of TopicComponent
    Endpoints REST:
    GET /keyphrase_clustering/{user}/{topic}/
      {keyphrase_order}

    Valida autenticação, tópico,
    converte parâmetro para enum,
    retorna {sorting, clusters}
  end note
}

' === CAMADA 2: Controller Layer ===
package "Controller Layer\n(controller/)" as ControllerLayer {
  [controller/annotation.py] as AnnotationComponent <<Controller>>
  note right of AnnotationComponent
    AnnotationController
    - get_keyphrase_clustering(sort_by)
    - Constrói response com
      {id: {description, clustering}}
    - Orquestra chamada ao model
  end note
}
RF(AnnotationComponent)

' === CAMADA 3: Model / Domain Layer ===
package "Model / Domain Layer\n(model/)" as ModelLayer {
  [model/annotation.py] as ClusterAnnotationComponent <<Domain Model>>
  note right of ClusterAnnotationComponent
    ClusterAnnotation
    extends KeyphraseClustering
    - get_keyphrase_descriptions(sort_by)
    - clustering: list (herdado)
  end note
  RF(ClusterAnnotationComponent)

  [model/cluster.py] as ClusterComponent <<Domain Model>>
  note right of ClusterComponent
    KeyphraseClustering
    - get_keyphrase_list(sort_by) → lista
      ordenada por similarity DESC
    - get_keyphrase_descriptions(sort_by) → dict

    ⭐ T007 — Algoritmo de pós-processamento:
    1. temp_list: monta tuplas
       (id, desc, best_pair_id, similarity)
    2. grouped_list: itera detectando
       reciprocidade (best_data[2] == kid)
    3. dict comprehension mantendo ordem

    to_list(sort_column=3, reverse=True)
  end note
  RF(ClusterComponent)

  [model/keyphrase.py] as KeyphraseComponent <<Entity>>
  note right of KeyphraseComponent
    Keyphrase
    - get_description(complement)
    - id, content, preprocessed_content

    KeyphraseSorting (enum):
    ALPHABETICAL, NUMERICAL,
    CLUSTER_SIMILARITY,
    PAIRWISE_SIMILARITY

    KeyphraseEmbeddings
    - similarity_matrix
    - get_similarity(kp1, kp2)
  end note
  RF(KeyphraseComponent)
}

' === CAMADA 4: Utility Layer ===
package "Utility Layer\n(util/)" as UtilLayer {
  [util/pairwise_similarity.py] as PairwiseComponent <<Utility>>
  note right of PairwiseComponent
    PairwiseSimilarity
    - get_pairwise_similarity()
    - Matriz de similaridade entre
      keyphrases
  end note
}

' === RELACIONAMENTOS ===

TopicComponent --> AnnotationComponent : <<calls>>\nget_keyphrase_clustering(sorting)
RF(TopicComponent)

AnnotationComponent --> ClusterAnnotationComponent : <<delegates>>\nget_keyphrase_descriptions(sort_by)

ClusterAnnotationComponent -up-|> ClusterComponent : extends
RF(ClusterAnnotationComponent)
RF(ClusterComponent)

ClusterComponent --> KeyphraseComponent : <<imports>>\nKeyphraseSorting,\nKeyphrase\nKeyphraseEmbeddings
RF(ClusterComponent)
RF(KeyphraseComponent)

ClusterComponent --> PairwiseComponent : <<uses>>\nPairwiseSimilarity
RF(ClusterComponent)

' === Destaque do algoritmo T007 ===

note bottom of ClusterComponent
  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
  ║      RF-008 — Algoritmo T007 (3etapas)    ║
  ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
  ║ 1. temp_list:                             ║
  ║    (id, desc, best_pair_id, similarity)    ║
  ║                                           ║
  ║ 2. grouped_list:                          ║
  ║    Para cada A não visitado:              ║
  ║    if B existe, não visitado,             ║
  ║       e best_data[2] == A[0]:             ║
  ║         [A, B] adjacentes  ←  RECÍPROCO  ║
  ║    else:                                  ║
  ║         [A] solo                          ║
  ║                                           ║
  ║ 3. keyphrase_descriptions =               ║
  ║    {item[0]: item[1]                      ║
  ║     for item in grouped_list}             ║
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
end note

@enduml